INDEX ./
F README.md            Both .cld species, what is in the box, the findings, the gate, known limits
F INSTALL.md           Adopting the toolkit in another repository; every cld.conf key; uninstalling
F CLAUDE.md            Working rules for this repo: portability, tests, the same-commit rule
F cld.conf             Shipped default config, copied into a host repo and edited there
D spec/                The two index format specs
D scripts/             The checkers, the symbol lookups, the shared scripts, the git hooks
D rules/               Snippets to paste into a host repo
D tests/               Fixture-based test suite for both checkers and the gate
D .claude/             The Claude Code session hook and the .cld skills
